# Aura paper fence

- Work only inside `SlimWojak/aura`; do not import, vendor, submodule, or write
  constellation/ATOM/RIVER clinical paths.
- Keep all trading work paper-only. Do not add live Kraken scopes, live keys,
  withdraw/funding/earn/subaccount tools, `all`, or `--allow-dangerous`.
- Kraken MCP is spot paper only: `market,paper`. Futures paper is CLI-only on
  dexter.
- Runtime data belongs on dexter under `/var/aura`; cloud agents should produce
  repo PRs and reviewable artifacts, not runtime state.
- No autopromote from paper to live. Agents propose; Risk/Ops and Slim decide.
